   "body": "**Operator UI comparison, 2026-11-11**: legacy asks for the notification permission at the first launch (`HFRswift/Swift/HFRswiftApp.swift:28` → `MPBackgroundService.requestNotificationAuthorization()`, `MPBackgroundService.swift:48-55` @ `87fe0d1c`); SwiftHFR never asks (no `requestAuthorization` call in the app). Question for the spec: ask at launch as legacy, or when the user turns MP notifications on in Réglages (Apple's guidance; an acceptable improvement)?\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
